WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
If you take a blood thinner medication, you may need to adjust your timing before the procedure.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:10.000
Blood thinners can affect our ability to safely address anything we find during your colonoscopy,

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.720
so getting the timing right matters. Please contact your doctor's office as soon as possible

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.920
if you haven't already discussed this with them. Do not stop or change your blood thinner on your own —

5
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.640
they will give you specific instructions based on your medication and your personal health history.

6
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.880
This is an important one, so please don't wait on it.
